  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "5a97371f731efefe1a4c659f6b7361461ad55e78ce2e4dd67a4e71b4ecc7bfd9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "252b87ef2750d0706a0030f3e8d6ecc667dcee0fd5aac5a99749f806d0fff92a",
      "text": "悟空看牙医",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b2c463b3aa41fd9e57528ac0867a7a143b7fe86b5c9d68fbd0361272b68a4c18",
      "text": "今天，悟空\n要去看牙医。\n沙僧陪他一起去。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62a8151ca8655ab7899a72f719a6f5b029e40031675f35d8fffddaf563212017",
      "text": "八戒也在候诊室。\n“嗨，悟空！”\n悟空看见一张大椅子。\n“哇！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f5d89dce8b1f0c1966e99e3d8481817eeb6f7e616c7d9372eb7520fd7c1e2231",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡！\n“是大蜜蜂吗？”\n悟空拉紧沙僧的手。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6bcee770d7ffd9c5ac0a901dc263fd9616d2fc76ccda71c1a2b6c1a021117157",
      "text": "牙医阿姨笑了。\n她的衣服上有好多小熊。\n“你好，悟空！\n我们先看一看。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9af34300269762038860de0fc7ef0fb4bbe994b7d27501f06531fb447b019b9d",
      "text": "她拿出一面小镜子：\n“它能帮我看清\n你的牙齿。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0995133efd7a197cca284e9bccec7aa9f6eed8460dfafa872e60aeee822cbc14",
      "text": "“如果你想停一下，\n就举起手，\n我就会停下来。”\n悟空点点头。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f16a68c713ba344614aa17b6cf05d1df8e00f8f109b297a01dcb1f8b9a43f77a",
      "text": "悟空爬上大椅子。\n牙医阿姨问：“准备好了吗？”\n椅子慢慢升高了！\n“像坐在小云朵上！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "715f6d65cd5d86b5fc13ea9a3f7823fa4d37384ca80ba10bb586f12d3f162d49",
      "text": "牙医阿姨说：“张大嘴巴。”\n“啊——”\n她一颗一颗地看。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a8e0a0c9d8fabcb6b77cda81de17d4ac822d1bdeafd1c4b8b9463188335b96b2",
      "text": "嗡——\n悟空有点害怕，\n他举起了手。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a8fb86742c89ffa0538b0b0134ad210fe0e9c51fbb8b4326e41d7965b077bd8",
      "text": "牙医阿姨马上停下来：\n“好的，我们停一停。”\n沙僧握住他的手。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bda019e6b52025fbad60290aeee82938796cdcbad120412607bba0eadae5456d",
      "text": "悟空问：\n“是什么在嗡嗡响？”\n牙医阿姨说：“是我的小刷子，\n有点痒痒的。”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e50d7462b5ce6ad0ac2415779e1fea526366418116b7de76dd4d81d44a9c9435",
      "text": "悟空说：\n“我准备好了。”\n他又张大了嘴巴。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "03714676e4eef998cc6ba4d5a03a1bbf78488133b4499d4514599acb5d6f9c90",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡，\n痒痒的！\n牙医阿姨说：“检查完啦！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df3b9fb48660ec98424f62c04cbf5c534918c1f9b95fcd7cdc27d29817838f7c",
      "text": "悟空照着小镜子笑：\n“我会告诉你我需要什么！”\n临走时，牙医阿姨\n送给他一把小牙刷。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "59d4fb01b05d4ea4363767d605cb111ed5e4e2efa70753a91f73c1343e9bc652",
      "text": "回到家，八戒的玩偶排好队。\n悟空说：“张大嘴巴！\n如果想停一下，\n就举起小爪子！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
